useful formula:

s,w
	s = rm(1)**2+2.*p0(4)*eglab-2.*p0(3)*eglab
	w = sqrt(s)

t
	-t = p - p'
	t = p' - p
	where:
	p  = final   proton 4-mom
	p' = initial proton 4-mom
	in case of    g + p -> p + r   (r = particle, res, pair, ...)
	t =  (pg-pR)^2 = mr^2 -2*Eg*Er + 2*|pg|*|pr|*cos(teta_gr)
	t =  mr^2 -2*Eg_cm*Er_cm + 2*Eg_cm*|pr_cm|*cos(teta_gr)
	Eg_cm = (w^2-mp^2)/2w
	Er_cm = (w^2+mr^2-mp^2)/2w


